# Layer A form of corpus/18-match-int-literal-with-wildcard.json — the
# smallest pattern-matching example. PLT for literal patterns, PWC for
# wildcard. The scrutinee is `0`, so the first case wins → 100.
@v=1 root=m
intT PRM Int
lit0 ILT 0
pat0 PLT intT lit0
body0 ILT 100
case0 MC pat0 body0
patAny PWC intT
bodyA ILT 200
caseA MC patAny bodyA
scrut ILT 0
m MAT scrut [case0 caseA]
